@startuml
!theme plain

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 22
skinparam BoxPadding 12

title Health Insurance Claim Agent - Simple System Flow

actor User

box "Frontend" #E8F4FD
  participant "Streamlit UI" as UI
end box

box "Backend" #EEF2FF
  participant "FastAPI" as API
  participant "Core Claim Agent" as AGENT
end box

box "Agent Tools" #E8FFE8
  participant "Document Verifier" as VERIFY
  participant "Document Extractor" as EXTRACT
  participant "Policy Checker" as POLICY
  participant "Fraud Detector" as FRAUD
  participant "Decision Maker" as DECIDE
end box

box "Data / AI Services" #FFF3E0
  entity "policy_terms.json" as TERMS
  participant "OpenAI" as OPENAI
  participant "Traces" as TRACES
end box

== Submit Claim ==
User -> UI: Upload documents\nand claim details
UI -> API: POST /api/claims
API -> AGENT: Send claim payload

== Agent Starts ==
AGENT -> TERMS: Load policy rules
TERMS --> AGENT: Policy terms

note right of AGENT
  Core Claim Agent decides
  which tool to call and when.
  It can stop early if documents fail.
end note

== Verify Documents ==
AGENT -> VERIFY: Check uploaded documents
VERIFY -> OPENAI: Classify document type\nand read patient name
OPENAI --> VERIFY: Verification result
VERIFY --> AGENT: Valid / missing / unreadable\nor name mismatch

alt Documents failed
  AGENT --> API: REJECTED or MANUAL_REVIEW
  API --> UI: Show issue to user
else Documents passed
  AGENT -> EXTRACT: Extract medical and bill data
  EXTRACT -> OPENAI: Read document contents
  OPENAI --> EXTRACT: Extracted fields
  EXTRACT --> AGENT: Patient, diagnosis,\nline items, total amount

  AGENT -> POLICY: Check policy eligibility
  POLICY -> TERMS: Use limits, exclusions,\nco-pay, network rules
  TERMS --> POLICY: Policy rules
  POLICY --> AGENT: Eligible amount\nand policy reasons

  AGENT -> FRAUD: Detect fraud signals
  FRAUD --> AGENT: Fraud score\nand review flag

  AGENT -> DECIDE: Combine all results
  DECIDE --> AGENT: APPROVED / PARTIAL /\nREJECTED / MANUAL_REVIEW

  AGENT -> TRACES: Save agent/tool trace
  AGENT --> API: Final decision JSON
  API --> UI: Decision, amount,\nreasoning, breakdown
  UI --> User: Show claim result
end

@enduml
